'''Verrack''' was a [[Mon Calamari]] [[captain]] who was one of the [[commander]]s of the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|rebel]] [[MC80A Home One Type Heavy Star Cruiser|MC80A ''Home One'' Type Heavy Star Cruiser]] ''[[Home One]]'' during the [[Battle of Endor]].<ref name="BMF 24" /> At the battle, he sat to the right of [[Admiral]] [[Gial Ackbar]] and warned him that there were [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Starship|ships]] in [[Sector 47]], which allowed the admiral to determine that the [[Rebel Alliance Navy|fleet]] had fallen into a trap. Verrack had [[Color|yellow]] [[eye]]s and brown-mottled skin.<ref name="Episode VI" />

==Behind the scenes==
Verrack first appeared in {{Film|VI}}. He was played by [[Gerald Home]], who was credited as a "mime artist."<ref name="SW.com Episode VI">{{SWArchive|url=movies/episode-vi|text=''Star Wars'': Episode VI ''Return of the Jedi''}}</ref>

